cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "PALs Lab Tools"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Open-source code for geospatial climate-and-health tools from Place Alert Labs (PALs Lab):
  the Climate & Health Atlas, PALs Earth, flood and health-facility accessibility models,
  exposure catalogues, Africa-wide road maps, course material and the PALs websites.
authors:
  - name: "Place Alert Labs (PALs Lab)"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Shmron/pals-lab-tools"
url: "https://placealert.org"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - climate and health
  - geospatial
  - Earth observation
  - Zimbabwe
  - Sub-Saharan Africa
